5. PROJECT IDENTITY AND PRODUCT VISION

EDISON is an international Smart TV advertising and opportunity network.

It has two principal functions.

A. Smart TV advertising

EDISON enables participating television environments to display appropriately scheduled advertisements during verified commercial breaks, using permitted TV integration methods.

B. Opportunity distribution

EDISON enables viewers to discover useful opportunities, particularly employment opportunities, through their televisions.

These include opportunities across all occupational levels:

- Domestic workers and house help.
- Drivers.
- Security personnel.
- General workers.
